         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Carry or Not Carry?\n\nIn every level, the question is the same: does this column carry 1 to the next order? The game always moves column by column, starting from the units.\n\nTo answer, follow three steps:\n\n1. **Value already in the column.** Take the digit of the top number and add the 1 carried from the column on the right, if there is one. The game shows this total.\n2. **Complement to 10.** See how much is missing to reach 10. That amount is the complement.\n3. **Digit you are adding.** If it is smaller than the complement, the total stays below 10 and the column does not carry. If it is equal to or greater than the complement, the total reaches 10 and the column carries 1 to the next column.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
